  "body": "This is a simple clarification hopefully not needing too much time. The current API definition says that `displayname` and `avatar_url` in `/profile/{}/displayname` and `/profile/{}/avatar_url` respectively are not required. However, Synapse complains - and I think rightfully - when I completely omit the parameter (in a wrong way but that's a [separate issue](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/8029)). Should Synapse or the spec be fixed?",
